Error [E0111]: `read` was made with `::`, so it can't be changed
  --> named_write_window_calls_keep_alias_and_read_view_checks_2.jet:9:11
    |
  9 |     bump(&read)
    |           ^^^^
 Why: `bump` will change this value, so it must be mutable (`:=`)
 Fix: Declare it with `read := ...`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0111

Error [E0212]: `values[…]` cannot be passed with write access while `read` is still looking into it
  --> named_write_window_calls_keep_alias_and_read_view_checks_2.jet:9:11
    |
  9 |     bump(&read)
    |           ^^^^
 Why: `read` is a live read view into `values[…]`; changing or moving the owner could invalidate that view
 Fix: Finish using `read` before changing `values[…]`, narrow the view's scope, or make an owned copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0212
